WEBVTT

00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:06.000
A sensor exposed to the internet, on a machine unrelated to this site.

00:00:06.000 --> 00:00:12.000
Scanners find it on their own: an emulated SSH shell, an HTTP maze and tarpits that hold the connection.

00:00:12.000 --> 00:00:20.000
Every interaction becomes an event, kept in a state store.

00:00:20.000 --> 00:00:30.500
Every 15 minutes, the events go out as a feed (JSON and text), a MISP export, a STIX 2.1 bundle and an HTML report.

00:00:30.500 --> 00:00:37.000
The history lands in history.json, which this site's Worker reads every 6 hours.

00:00:37.000 --> 00:00:41.000
That becomes the project's aggregate summary. No IP address passes through this site.

00:00:41.000 --> 00:00:48.000
The full feed, dossiers and reports are at intel.danielmala.co.
